<title>JAPAN: Shinki Bus - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinki Bus - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.28		vs	   10.90</p>
<p> Operating	  574    million	  vs	  676    million</p>
<p> Current	    516    million	  vs	  583    million</p>
<p> Net		  474    million	  vs	  568    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.60 yen	  vs	   19.89 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  1.75 yen	  vs	    1.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinki Bus Co Ltd is a major bus operator.</p>
